wazigate (3.1.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Adding VPN
  * VPN remote access added, configurable from the dashboard
  * UPS module support added
  * Network traffic drastically reduced
  * Automatic token refresh in the dashboard
  * MQTT and REST API addresses configurable
  * LoRa downlink payload and queue fixed
  * System resource reporting hardened
  * Automatic service restart after crash or reboot
  * Base images updated, Go toolchain pinned, build caching added
  * Redundant API endpoints removed, VPN routes documented

 -- Felix Markwordt <felix.markwordt@waziup.org>  Mon, 24 Aug 2026 14:53:53 +0200

